    74	## 2. Exact multisection formula
    75	
    76	For a reduced curve `H` on a smooth projective surface, let its irreducible
    77	components have normalization genera `g_i`, let `m_q` be the number of
    78	analytic branches at a singular point, let `s` be the component count, and
    79	let `c` be the connected-component count.  Direct edge/vertex cancellation
    80	in an embedded resolution gives
