+## 1. Exact unbalanced cells and the U3 calculation — `CONFIRMED`
+
+Expand
+
+\[
+h=(1+v)z^3-(2v+v^2)z^2+v^2z,
+\qquad
+f=h+u(a(z)u+b(z)v+c(z)).
+\]
+
+Put (a_0=a(0)), (b_0=b(0)), and (c_1=c'(0)). The unbalanced locus is
+(b_0=0). There are then only two cases:
