+
+Hence (x_1) is the surface uniformizer and
+(operatorname{ord}(z)=2), not one. In original coordinates
+(y=zy_1+O(z^2)), (u=zx_1/a_0+O(z^2)), and
+
+\[
+p=z^2\{y_1(y_1+2)+O(x_1,z)\}.
