+### 6.2 All contracted carriers and coefficients
+
+Independently write a contracted carrier as
+(Z=aS_0+bF-\sum x_iP_i). The charged carrier identities
+(B.Z=1, A.Z=0, Z^2=-3), together with (Z.S_0=0), give
