+### 6.3 Chronological U roots and totals
+
+Reversing the fibre contractions gives
+
+\[
+R_s=F-P_1-P_2,\quad R_{s-1}=P_1-P_2,
+\quad R_{s-2}=P_2-P_3,\ldots,
+R_1=P_{s-1}-P_s,\quad L=P_s.
