+### 6.4 Missing root family and exact repair
+
+Producer lines 199-201 incorrectly call (P_i-P_j) the general integral
+root satisfying (A.Q=B.Q=K.Q=0, Q^2=-2). Write
+(Q=bF+\sum q_iP_i). Those equations give
