+## 8. Closed-form intersection obstruction — `CONFIRMED`
+
+After item 7,
+
+\[
+C_j=a_jS_0+2a_jF-\sum_lx_{jl}P_l.
+\]
+
+For (j\ne k),
+
+\[
+C_j.C_k=2a_ja_k-\sum_lx_{jl}x_{kl}.
+\]
+
+Put (c_l=\sum_jx_{jl}) and
+(Q=\sum_{j,l}x_{jl}^2). Since
