+\[
+\sum_lc_l^2=Q+2\sum_{j<k,l}x_{jl}x_{kl},
+\]
+
+one obtains the exact identity
+
+\[
+\sum_{j<k}C_j.C_k
+=2\sum_{j<k}a_ja_k-\frac{\sum_lc_l^2-Q}{2}.
+\]
+
+Every (x_{jl}) is a nonnegative integer, hence (x_{jl}^2\ge x_{jl}) and
+
+\[
+Q\ge\sum_{j,l}x_{jl}=\sum_lc_l.
+\]
