+## 2. Exact D square completion — `CONFIRMED`
+
+Assume (b(0)=c'(0)=0), and write
+
+\[
+b=zB,\quad c=z^2C,\quad y=z-v,\quad \Delta=B+C,
+\quad L=bv+c=z(-By+z\Delta).
+\]
+
+Since (a_0\ne0), (a) is a unit. Set (x=au+L/2). Then, without
+discarding a term,
+
+\[
+af=x^2+ah-L^2/4.
+\]
