+\[
+U(a_0U+\delta)=0,\qquad \gamma U+2Y_0+1=0.
+\]
+
+The roots (U=0) and (U=-\delta/a_0) are distinct. The second is a
+smooth degree-two germ. At the zero root (Y_0=-1/2); substituting
+(u=Wz^3) in the next surface term gives
+
