+\[
+a_0u^2-z^5/4=0.
+\]
+
+Since (gcd(2,5)=1), this is one irreducible reduced branch
+
+\[
+z=t^2,\qquad u=kt^5+\cdots,\qquad k^2=1/(4a_0),
+\]
+
+of degree five. It combines with the transverse degree-three cusp to give
