+For example, on generic (E_1) the surface equation gives
+(U=-v(Z-1)^2/c_1+\cdots), and
+(p=2v^2Z(Z-1)+\cdots). In the residual A1 (Z)-chart
+(v=ZV, U=ZW), (p=Z^2V(c_1W+V+\cdots)), giving the middle order two.
