+\[
+h=zy\{y(1-z)+z^2\}.
+\]
+
+With weights ((z,y,u)=(1,2,4)), the fixed-(v) derivative is
+(partial_z+partial_y), and the leading polar equation is
+(z(2y+z^2)=0). The strict solution is
