+\[
+d_j=A.C_j=5a_j-\sum_i x_{ji}>0
+\]
+
+for every displayed local polar degree and every (x_{ji}\ge0), one must
+have (a_j\ge1). Thus every strict polar prime is horizontal, but not for the
+reason printed there.
