+equation in D5 form (x^2+zy^2+\text{unit}\,z^4=0). If (delta=0), then
+(Delta^2=O(z^2)), while (P(0)=Q(0)=a_0), so
+
+\[
+K=z(a_0+O(z)).
+\]
+
+The forced coefficient of (z^5) is nonzero. The singularity is exactly D6;
