+
+For clarity, representative valuations of ((z,y,u;p)) are
+(E_1:(2,1,2;2)), (E_2:(2,2,3;4)),
+(E_3:(2,3,4;5)), and (E_4,E_5:(1,2,\ge2;3)).
+Literal Cartan multiplication, now only a check on the resolved calculation,
