+| row | (r_0) | forced positive-A primes | remaining choices |
+|---|---:|---:|---|
+| B5/A4 | 4 | 3 | baseline; one A-null (Z); or one affine A1 tree |
+| B6/A5 | 5 | 2 | baseline; one A-null (Z); or one affine A1 tree |
